      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use the saved finding, original issue/PR text\nand exact retrieved excerpts.\n\nKeep the repo revision and date. Record the\navailable evidence; do not silently add future\nfixes.\n\n71 cases are saved with blank review fields.",
      "originalText": "Use the saved finding, original issue/PR text\nand exact retrieved excerpts.\n\nKeep the repo revision and date. Record the\navailable evidence; do not silently add future\nfixes.\n\n71 cases are saved with blank review fields.",
