      "text": "Hide Luna and Jev verdicts.\n\nIs the claimed behavior established? Do the\ndocs already answer the question? Is a draft\njustified?\n\nAllow unknown. For stronger ground truth,\nseparately inspect pinned implementation\ncode.",
